  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521965
    - rid: 4351268438874521966
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Good morning, Yuri!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521967
    - rid: 4351268438874521969
    - rid: 4351268438874521970
    - rid: 4351268438874521972
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Good morning to you too, Sayori.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what's on the agenda for today?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521973
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: As much as I want to experiment further with teleportation and telepathy...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521974
    - rid: 4351268438874521975
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: We should probably learn more about the basics.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521976
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you ever manage to figure out the Oakflesh spell, Sayori?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521978
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ... ehehe... no...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, I suppose that's what <i>you'll</i> be doing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521979
    - rid: 4351268438874521980
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Bah!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: The two girls make their way to the Hall of Elements, so they can head
      through to the Arcanaeum.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099482212892770
    - rid: 268099503569240127
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Hey! They moved the Eye of Mangos!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240128
    - rid: 268099503569240129
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Eye of <i>Magnus</i>, Sayori.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240130
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that's right. Thanks, Yuri.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240131
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, it's you two! Please, come here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240132
    - rid: 268099503569240133
    - rid: 268099503569240134
    - rid: 268099503569240135
    - rid: 268099503569240136
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you need something, Mr. Tolfdir?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240137
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: It's not a need exactly, but...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240138
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'd like someone to bounce my observations off of, in case I missed something.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Your observations regarding the Eye of Magnus?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240139
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Is <i>that</i> what this thing's called? How'd you figure that out?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240140
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: We, uh, read up about it in a book!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240141
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh? And which book is that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't remember...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: But even if you wanted to read it, you couldn't.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240142
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Because, after we read it, some other student borrowed it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240143
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I see...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240144
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (How'd you come up with that lie, Sayori?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240145
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I just remembered what {mc} said about what we should've been doing
      next.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240146
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (I thought the whole "missing books" thing would be a good excuse.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240147
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (That's pretty clever, Sayori!)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240148
    - rid: 268099503569240150
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240151
    - rid: 268099503569240152
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sure you've already noticed the markings on this thing.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240153
    - rid: 268099503569240154
    - rid: 268099503569240155
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: They're not like anything we've ever seen before.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Ayleid, Daedric, Dwemer, Falmer... none of them are a match.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Although, if this sphere really <i>is</i> associated with Magnus, it's
      possible that it's Ehlnofex.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Quite curious indeed.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Additionally, this thing all but radiates pure magicka.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, again, could be another point toward being associated with Magnus...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Arch-Mage Aren is currently looking into it, so we should probably tell
      him about-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: You two, you're coming with me. Now.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240156
    - rid: 268099503569240157
    - rid: 268099503569240158
    - rid: 268099503569240159
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: How rude! Why, I never-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240165
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: We were in the middle of something here!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: And whatever you're doing is <i>more</i> important than the Psijic mage
      in the Arch-Mage's quarters?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... ah... That <i>is</i> pretty important.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: But why are you asking for these two?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: That's what I hope to find out; the Psijic mage is asking for these two
      specifically.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: So, we're going to see what this mage wants together.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: As annoying as this is, you two should probably head with Ancano for
      now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (But {mc} said we shouldn't get involved with Ancano.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240160
    - rid: 268099503569240161
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, Ancano doesn't seem to be too interested in the Eye yet, so maybe
      it's okay to go along with him for now?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240162
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Alright...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240163
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240164
    - rid: 268099503569240166
    - rid: 268099503569240167
    - rid: 268099503569240168
    - rid: 268099503569240169
    - rid: 268099503569240170
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: Now, speak to this monk, and then we will throw him off of the college
      grounds.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240171
    - rid: 268099503569240172
    - rid: 268099503569240173
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, it's you again.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240174
    - rid: 268099503569240175
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right; the situation at your College is of dire importance-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240176
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Because of the Eye of Magnus? We sorta know about that already.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240177
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yes. The longer it remains, the more dangerous it becomes; I have come
      here personally to tell you it must be dealt with.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240178
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, so we should go get the Staff of Magnus from Lab-rat-ian, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240179
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: The Staff of Magnus-?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Interesting. That <i>could</i> work.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240180
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: It seems we've underestimated your tenacity, mage.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: <i>My</i> tenacity...? Ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240181
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: I <i>was</i> going to suggest meeting with the Augur of Dunlain-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: But, I suspect the Staff of Magnus should be what you need to avert disaster.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Is that it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240182
    - rid: 268099503569240183
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: That should be all, yes.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240184
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: But you've just arrived?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... were you being literal when you said you wanted to <i>see</i> these
      two?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e683e49275a2e914cb83757b791de99d, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, yes, so I'll be leaving now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Nerien teleports away.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240185
    - rid: 268099795830177893
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... strange.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: ... hrmn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Did he stop time and talk to you, again?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yep.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... so?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (So what?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240186
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (What did he say, Sayori?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240187
    - rid: 268099503569240188
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (He was talking about how the Eye of Magnus is really dangerous and we
      should do something about it.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240189
    - rid: 268099503569240191
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (So we need to go to Labyrinthian?)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Seems like it, yeah.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Well, the Arch-Mage is right here, so...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240192
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: (Yeah, but so's Ancano...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240193
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Arch-Mage Aren, we should talk in private about that Psijic mage.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240194
    - rid: 268099503569240195
    - rid: 268099503569240196
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... excluding Ancano, correct?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240197
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: That's right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240198
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: Nonsense.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240199
    - rid: 268099503569240200
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: This matter is highly unusual, and of the upmost importance.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: The Thalmor potentially have a vested interest-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: You heard the girl. Get out.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3a4fe2bf30f193641a10aa95dbb7f4df, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I'll remember this.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what did he talk about in that frozen time?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240201
    - rid: 268099503569240202
    - rid: 268099503569240203
    - rid: 268099503569240204
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: You noticed that?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I did, there's a reason <i>I</i> am the Arch-Mage.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess you're right, ehehe...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240205
    - rid: 268099503569240207
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: He said that the Eye of Magnus is dangerous and we should do something
      about it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240206
    - rid: 268099503569240208
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... did he say anything specific?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: When I mentioned the Staff of Magnus, he said we should look into that.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240209
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: The Staff of Magnus?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240210
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: ... oh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose it's time, after all of these years.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240211
    - rid: 268099503569240212
    - rid: 268099503569240215
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: It's time? Time for what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Time for my return to Labyrinthian.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240223
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dd903fc51212df42958a6834f3e050b, type: 2}
    dialog: Come. We're going now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Are you sure we should be going with you?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099503569240216
